PineAI backend assets

- pineai_backend/ contains the standard-library-only Target Profiler,
  engagement store, Attack-Path Advisor and Adaptive Recon planner.
- pineai_cli.py provides configuration, profiling, engagement, advisory and
  operator-approved Recon plan lifecycle commands.
- The Angular frontend can manage non-secret preferences and a managed API key
  through module actions. Secrets are never returned to the browser.

See the repository docs/backend.md, docs/attack-path-advisor.md and
docs/adaptive-recon.md for the API, privacy model and CLI usage. The complete
frontend workflow is documented in docs/frontend.md.
